                            "text": "<p>Reece's trade teams are always on the move. Lifting, hauling, working through every condition. Their uniforms needed to perform — not just look the part. We built a program around that reality. Safety-compliant, durable and made to measure across a national workforce.</p>",
                            "device_visibility": "all",
                            "width": "100%",
                            "max_width": "normal",
                            "alignment": "left",
                            "type_preset": "custom",
                            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                            "font_size": "0.875rem",
                            "line_height": "loose",
                            "letter_spacing": "normal",
                            "case": "none",
                            "wrap": "pretty",
                            "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                            "background": false,
                            "background_color": "#00000026",
                            "corner_radius": 0,
                            "padding-block-start": 0,
                            "padding-block-end": 0,
                            "padding-inline-start": 0,
                            "padding-inline-end": 0
                          },
                          "blocks": {}
                        }
                      },
                      "block_order": [
                        "text_RAGdEQ"
                      ]
                    },
                    "accordion_row_gHYCdz": {
                      "type": "_accordion-row",
                      "settings": {
                        "heading": "Our Custom Uniform Solution",
                        "open_by_default": false,
                        "icon": "none",
                        "width": 20,
                        "scroll_to_reviews": false
                      },
                      "blocks": {
                        "text_wCK9yV": {
                          "type": "text",
                          "settings": {
                            "class_name": "",
                            "text": "<p>The pieces that set Reece's trade range apart. A signature polo with white trim — branded, durable, worn across every site. Custom headwear designed for outdoor work: sun protection, branded appearance, built to last. And a Reconciliation polo bringing commissioned Indigenous artwork to life — a considered piece that reflected Reece's commitment to community.</p>",
                            "device_visibility": "all",
                            "width": "100%",
                            "max_width": "normal",
                            "alignment": "left",
                            "type_preset": "custom",
                            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                            "font_size": "0.875rem",
                            "line_height": "loose",
                            "letter_spacing": "normal",
                            "case": "none",
                            "wrap": "pretty",
                            "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                            "background": false,
                            "background_color": "#00000026",
                            "corner_radius": 0,
                            "padding-block-start": 0,
                            "padding-block-end": 0,
                            "padding-inline-start": 0,
                            "padding-inline-end": 0
                          },
                          "blocks": {}
                        }
                      },
                      "block_order": [
                        "text_wCK9yV"
                      ]
                    },
                    "accordion_row_rwKWhT": {
                      "type": "_accordion-row",
                      "settings": {
                        "heading": "Reece's Stocked Uniform Solution",
                        "open_by_default": false,
                        "icon": "none",
                        "width": 20,
                        "scroll_to_reviews": false
                      },
                      "blocks": {
                        "text_PEx76n": {
                          "type": "text",
                          "settings": {
                            "class_name": "",
                            "text": "<p>Reece's trade teams don't slow down. Neither should their gear. We supplied steel-toe boots and hi-vis fleece for protection where it matters most — then engineered the rest around injury prevention and all-day comfort. Sweat-wicking fabrics. Ergonomic fits. Reinforced panels. Hi-vis elements. Tough stitching. Real safety isn't compliance. It's how gear moves, fits and holds up on the job.</p>",
                            "device_visibility": "all",
                            "width": "100%",
                            "max_width": "none",
                            "alignment": "left",
                            "type_preset": "custom",
                            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                            "font_size": "0.875rem",
                            "line_height": "loose",
                            "letter_spacing": "normal",
                            "case": "none",
                            "wrap": "pretty",
                            "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                            "background": false,
                            "background_color": "#00000026",
                            "corner_radius": 0,
                            "padding-block-start": 0,
                            "padding-block-end": 0,
                            "padding-inline-start": 0,
                            "padding-inline-end": 0
                          },
                          "blocks": {}
                        }
                      },
                      "block_order": [
                        "text_PEx76n"
                      ]
                    },
                    "accordion_row_bTjE7i": {
                      "type": "_accordion-row",
                      "settings": {
                        "heading": "How We Delivered",
                        "open_by_default": false,
                        "icon": "none",
                        "width": 20,
                        "scroll_to_reviews": false
                      },
                      "blocks": {
                        "text_wzmrNB": {
                          "type": "text",
                          "settings": {
                            "class_name": "",
                            "text": "<p>Three months. 8,000+ staff. We coordinated production locally and offshore to meet Reece's deadline without compromise. A tailored online portal handled ordering, inventory and compliance across every site — less admin, more time where it was needed. Outdated stock phased out. Costs brought in line.</p>",
                            "device_visibility": "all",
                            "width": "100%",
                            "max_width": "none",
                            "alignment": "left",
                            "type_preset": "custom",
                            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                            "font_size": "0.875rem",
                            "line_height": "loose",
                            "letter_spacing": "normal",
                            "case": "none",
                            "wrap": "pretty",
                            "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                            "background": false,
                            "background_color": "#00000026",
                            "corner_radius": 0,
                            "padding-block-start": 0,
                            "padding-block-end": 0,
                            "padding-inline-start": 0,
                            "padding-inline-end": 0
                          },
                          "blocks": {}
                        }
                      },
                      "block_order": [
                        "text_wzmrNB"
                      ]
                    },
                    "accordion_row_YzyQGw": {
                      "type": "_accordion-row",
                      "settings": {
                        "heading": "Services Provided",
                        "open_by_default": false,
                        "icon": "none",
                        "width": 20,
                        "scroll_to_reviews": false
                      },
                      "blocks": {
                        "text_pbzzEU": {
                          "type": "text",
                          "settings": {
                            "class_name": "",
                            "text": "<p>Bespoke and stock service uniforms. Steel-toe boots and hi-vis safety wear. Digital and printed uniform catalogue. Made-for-you uniform service. Customised online portal with extended functions.</p>",
                            "device_visibility": "all",
                            "width": "100%",
